# Goal
string prompt   # assembled prompt / context to reason over
string schema   # optional JSON shape/schema hint the reply must match; empty = free-form text
sensor_msgs/CompressedImage[] images   # optional frames to reason over (empty = text-only); order is meaningful (e.g. before, after)
---
# Result
bool success    # true when the model returned a usable reply (valid JSON when a schema was requested)
string response # the model's reply: canonical JSON when a schema was requested, else raw text; the failure reason when success is false
---
# Feedback
string state    # "RUNNING" while the API call is in flight
